OL,3,GNEWSADouglas Head designated a
OL,4,AConservation Area
OL,5,
OL,6,FDouglas Head has been formally
OL,7,Fdesignated a Conservation Area by the
OL,8,FManx government.
OL,10,FDouglas City Council said it "welcomed"
OL,11,Fthe move, recognising the headland's
OL,12,F"significant historical, architectural
OL,13,Fand cultural importance".
OL,15,FIt follows years of campaigning by
OL,16,Flocal historians and two public
OL,17,Fconsultations, the most recent of which
OL,18,Ffound 92% support for the move.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
