OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADouglas Head designated a
OL,4,AConservation Area
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the designation does not prevent
OL,7,Fall development on the headland, it
OL,8,Fdoes restrict the kind of changes
OL,9,Fowners to property within the boundary
OL,10,Fcan make without first obtaining
OL,11,Fplanning permission.
